1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,812
This is why a lawn grows back after it is mown.

2
00:00:02,812 --> 00:00:06,536
The mower takes the tips, and the apical meristems with them.

3
00:00:06,536 --> 00:00:13,385
But the intercalary meristems at the base of each leaf are untouched, and they push the blade back up.

4
00:00:13,385 --> 00:00:17,825
It is also why a bamboo culm can elongate so fast.

